    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1119">

                <pb facs="1139" n="853" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg853"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 867.48/420</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-22T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 22, 1916, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2978. Your confidential 2073, September 7, 9 a. m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1119-f1"
                    /> Report further details this matter. What if any action by Department in your
                    opinion would alleviate conditions?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
